{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120829","id":3972866756,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7szSLE","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120829","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120829.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120829.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120829","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120829/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120829/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120829/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/14c934b9c471061bf2cd983d4674c3b531fffe4d","number":120829,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Switch CSG tangent generation to meshopt_generateTangents","user":{"login":"zeux","id":1106629,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDY2Mjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1106629?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux","html_url":"https://github.com/zeux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This is a followup to #119161 and replaces CSG tangent generation with the same algorithm.\r\n\r\nSince CSGShape does not use SurfaceTool, we replicate the code to copy tangent inputs and generate tangents here directly; the CSG data is not indexed so we do not need any complex post-processing like vertex splitting.\r\n\r\nThe time tangent generation takes during CSG operations tends to not be very significant but this ensures we use consistent tangent algorithm everywhere, and removes the dependency on mikktspace library.\r\n\r\nTested using tangent visualization patch (https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24402824/tangent-debug.patch) but showing `binormal` here to ensure sign remains consistent too:\r\n\r\nmode | autosmooth off | autosmooth on\r\n-|--|--\r\nbefore | <img width=\"602\" height=\"949\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/03e40986-e8f8-4bc5-8046-6b6d3518e9e5\" /> | <img width=\"602\" height=\"949\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bf6c2048-4999-4d67-baee-8c29ff94da6c\" />\r\nafter | <img width=\"602\" height=\"949\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ab06b1b3-68dc-4e35-8cf9-3cff90303b39\" /> | <img width=\"602\" height=\"949\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0190648d-38ca-4cc8-a359-4ea2ed5ea89a\" />\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":2